# 3. YouTube Data API v3 (Optional for Bulk Playlist Ingestion)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used by the Admin Dashboard (/admin) to auto-fetch all video IDs in a playlist.
# Can be the exact same Google Cloud API key if YouTube Data API v3 is enabled.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
